From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 23:58:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ActiveAE: hand a late start over to the clock in whole vsyncs

A late start of decoded audio plays and is left to the player's clock,
whose drift path moves it by at most one content frame under a vsync
adjust and not at all under a speed adjust. Audio starts off by the
rest. A move by part of a vsync also shifts the clock sync phase.
